      en: ["The palace was named in honor of Morocco's King Mohammed V.", "It currently functions as the primary seat of the Presidency of Guinea.", "The building is situated on the waterfront of the Kaloum Peninsula.", "Moroccan influence is clearly visible in the palace's architectural details.", "It serves as the venue for international summits and official state banquets.", "The palace is a symbol of modern Guinean sovereignty and regional partnership."],
